  "description": "Cross-tier identity-graph .NET twin for the LevelUp.Health backend: the C# adapter generated from the single-source identity-graph.yaml (link columns, invariants, match policy), the hand-written role-to-resource link requirements, and the fail-safe IIdentityPersonLinkResolver implementation that fills the no-op seam left by LevelUp.Health.Fhir. Fail-safe means it reports UNKNOWN rather than throwing: ResolveLinkingPersonIdsAsync returns a Result whose failure means the linking Person set could not be established, which is distinct from a successful empty list meaning nothing links the resource. Requires LevelUp.Health.Fhir >= 0.2.0-rc.1: the port is declared there and implemented here, so the two packages must be upgraded together or the implementation stops satisfying its interface with no compile error.",
